      "text": "Lamanites shall come to knowledge of the Redeemer and points of his doctrine, 1 Ne. 15:14. this is doctrine of Christ, 2 Ne. 31:21 (32:6). Sherem seeks to overthrow doctrine of Christ, Jacob 7:2. do not risk one more offense against God upon points of doctrine, Alma 41:9. those who know doctrine through revelation put an end to contentions, Hel. 11:22–23. Satan leads men to believe doctrine of Christ is foolish, 3 Ne. 2:2. there shall be no disputations concerning points of doctrine, 3 Ne. 11:28. it is not Christ’s doctrine to stir up hearts of men with anger, 3 Ne. 11:30. this is my doctrine, 3 Ne. 11:32, 35, 39. whoso establishes more or less for Christ’s doctrine comes of evil, 3 Ne. 11:40. Gentiles to know true points of doctrine, 3 Ne. 21:6.",
